{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21035","main_id":21035,"main_title":"剑去之日","main_description":"古华派弟子孙宇，似乎正在思考着某事…","chapter_title":"剑去之日","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2103501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103501,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":210350108,"next_line_ids":[210350109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2400,"speaker_text_hash":2646233645,"speaker":"孙宇","speaker_raw":"孙宇","text_hash":2044285938,"text":"咳，说来惭愧。之前我虽然一直说着要复兴古华派，但平日里的行动…说是访仙，其实也就是在绝云间里闲逛罢了…","raw_text":"咳，说来惭愧。之前我虽然一直说着要复兴古华派，但平日里的行动…说是访仙，其实也就是在绝云间里闲逛罢了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21035","main_id":21035,"main_title":"剑去之日","main_description":"古华派弟子孙宇，似乎正在思考着某事…","chapter_title":"剑去之日","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2103501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103501,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":210350109,"next_line_ids":[210350110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2400,"speaker_text_hash":2646233645,"speaker":"孙宇","speaker_raw":"孙宇","text_hash":1919041074,"text":"虽然承蒙师妹不弃，但我内心深知，如此行为，对复兴古华派实无意义…","raw_text":"虽然承蒙师妹不弃，但我内心深知，如此行为，对复兴古华派实无意义…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103501.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21035","main_id":21035,"main_title":"剑去之日","main_description":"古华派弟子孙宇，似乎正在思考着某事…","chapter_title":"剑去之日","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2103501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103501,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":210350110,"next_line_ids":[210350111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2400,"speaker_text_hash":2646233645,"speaker":"孙宇","speaker_raw":"孙宇","text_hash":417847858,"text":"前段时间，当我回城里采买物资的时候，偶然和一个枫丹来的客商聊了两句。","raw_text":"前段时间，当我回城里采买物资的时候，偶然和一个枫丹来的客商聊了两句。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103501.json"}
