{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21035","main_id":21035,"main_title":"剑去之日","main_description":"古华派弟子孙宇，似乎正在思考着某事…","chapter_title":"剑去之日","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2103501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2103501,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":210350112,"next_line_ids":[210350113,210350114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":2400,"speaker_text_hash":2646233645,"speaker":"孙宇","speaker_raw":"孙宇","text_hash":2172401650,"text":"我想了好久…也许这位枫丹客商，是在建议我去璃月之外的地方游历一下吧。","raw_text":"我想了好久…也许这位枫丹客商，是在建议我去璃月之外的地方游历一下吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2103501.json"}
